tly waiting for their chance to once again plague the lands of the living.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024480/extras/8e6eabb45390be646d7368ad5992187c.avif?t=1743413613\" width=616 height=160 /></span><br><br>Meanwhile, in Esain - The Frozen North, another bloodline of vampires resides in solitude and isolation from the world. For the mystical clan of the Moroia, magic is blood, and blood is magic... and it runs thick in their cold, blue veins. No being \u2013 living or dead \u2013 dares interrupt their dark rituals and bloody soir\u00e9es.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024480/extras/67b86604e54bfdd5a2c6ee0715539e8a.avif?t=1743413613\" width=616 height=160 /></span><br><br>Tonight, the smell of blood is strong on the wind, and a red moon lights up the dark sky. A new vampire war is imminent, and none will be spared from the coming horrors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024480/extras/5f147d1f9dc55831111d9b4bb333a735.webp?t=1743413613\" width=616 height=29 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Truth Unfolds: </strong>Discover the secrets of Nemire, and experience an enthralling story spanning across 12 meticulously crafted missions and four unique environments, from the perspective of four mighty vampire lords, each with their own goals and agendas.<br></li><li><strong>Discover the Bloodlines:</strong> Command one of three unique vampire clans with distinctive units, powers, gameplay mechanics and characters. Play as the bloodthirsty Dracul, the ancient Nosfernus or the mystical Moroia!<br></li><li><strong>Vampiric powers:</strong> Original card game elements enhance the gameplay and provide a refreshing take on the genre. Each clan and vampire lord has access to their own set of cards, which can be synergized into powerful combinations.<br></li><li><strong>Strategy &amp; Tactics:</strong> Command your armies, recruit new units and unlock crucial technologies in the strategic Kingdom mode, and then put your tactical skills to the test in the action-packed Combat mode.<br></li><li><strong>Varied Content:</strong> Choose from three different gameplay modes, such as the story-driven Campaign, the open-world Sandbox, and the hard-fought Skirmish mode.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024480/extras/5f147d1f9dc55831111d9b4bb333a735.webp?t=1743413613\" width=616 height=29 /></span>","developers":["Palindrome Interactive"],"dlc":[1128391,1243070],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024480/header.jpg?t=1743413613","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":70,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/immortal-realms-vampire-wars?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1024480/308581/ca0555a25bf5bf8b7f1a7452079ae4ecb6bdf4be/1751177965/dash_av1.mpd?t=1607367381","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1024480/308581/ca0555a25bf5bf8b7f1a7452079ae4ecb6bdf4be/1751177965/dash_h264.mpd?t=1607367381","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1024480/308581/ca0555a25bf5bf8b7f1a7452079ae4ecb6bdf4be/1751177965/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1607367381","